{% doc %}
  Seven days after a ticket was marked resolved, close it.

  Why a delayed event and not a nightly sweep: a module cannot install a
  scheduled job on its host, so the only clock available is the one a
  consumer carries. Each resolved ticket schedules its own.

  Thin on purpose. The decision lives in the command, where it can be
  exercised without waiting a week.

  @param {object} event - The ticket_solved payload
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  function _ = 'modules/support/commands/tickets/close_if_due', ticket_id: event.ticket_id
%}
